cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper in preferred-citation. This repository is a
  modified version of iFogSim2 (CLOUDS Laboratory, University of Melbourne), which builds on
  iFogSim and CloudSim; please also cite iFogSim2 and iFogSim (see references). The author
  listed below wrote the changes made in this repository since May 2023; the rest of the code
  comes from iFogSim2 and the projects it builds on. This file describes the repository as a
  whole; the archived version used for CCGrid 2025 is identified under identifiers.
title: "iFogSim with application-level and communication energy accounting"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/saeedehbaneshi/IFogSim"
